+/* The seat's grab while a row captures, under Caminito. The keyboard is
+ * grabbed on its own first, since that's the grab GDK holds a shortcuts
+ * inhibitor for on Wayland, and with one Caminito gives the dialog the
+ * presses its System shortcuts would otherwise take (184). Then the rest
